node_modules
**/node_modules
server/dist
server/public
web/dist
data
**/data
.git
**/.git
*.log
.DS_Store
sample-vault
# The vault is bind-mounted at runtime (VAULT_HOST_PATH) — never bake the
# multi-GB obsvault LFS clone into the build context, or `COPY . .` crawls.
obsvault
*.tsbuildinfo
desktop/dist
desktop/release
# Runtime secrets and dev-session artifacts. Plain `data`/`.git` above only
# match at the repo root — Docker's .dockerignore matches by path, not by
# basename at every depth — so a worktree left under .claude/worktrees/*/data
# (real settings.json, real jwtSecret) or a stray .env would otherwise still
# get pulled into the build layer by `COPY . .`.
.env
.env.*
.claude
docs
*.md
